      "text": "赛前选择斗士、站位和行为指令，战斗自动演算并检验克制判断",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Choose gladiators for each fight, position them, and instruct their behavior. The battle will play out on its own, showing you the results of your strategy. Keep a close watch on your enemy, understand their moves, and figure out how to best counter them.",
