      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "斗士特质决定额外能力，可从市场淘人或训练升级特质并搭配装备",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Gladiators have traits that determine their bonuses and additional abilities. You can find great deals in the market or teach and upgrade traits as you form the strategy for your team. Unleash your creativity by growing your unique team. Level them up, upgrade traits, and equip them with powerful items, all while planning carefully how to build the most efficient team of gladiators that work well together.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1043260/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "每轮选择不同主要阵营，改变主线任务、结局和队伍策略",
